<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Mise à jour en cours</title>
    {# Deliberately NOT extending base.html.twig, and no external CSS/JS at
       all: this page can render mid-'installing', while
       Task\InstallUpdateHandler::installFiles() is actively copying the
       new file tree over the live one — an external stylesheet or script
       requested at that exact moment could be missing, truncated, or a
       mismatched mix of old/new versions.

       The periodic re-check is an INLINE, nonced script rather than an
       automatic page refresh in a meta tag: a page that reloads itself
       out from under a reader interrupts a screen reader mid-sentence and
       takes the back button with it (WCAG 2.2.1, Sonar
       Web:MetaRefreshCheck). Inline is not the concern above — nothing is
       fetched — and the nonce is the same one the style element below
       uses. Without scripting the link in the card is the manual
       equivalent, which is what a visitor needs anyway.

       The <style> below does carry a nonce: since style-src-elem dropped
       'unsafe-inline' (Core\Http\Response::buildStyleSrc()), an inline
       style ELEMENT needs one or the browser refuses it — and this page
       has nowhere else to put its CSS, precisely because it may not load
       an external stylesheet. FrontController::renderMaintenanceInProgress()
       returns an ordinary Response, so public/index.php stamps it with
       the same per-request nonce the template reads here. #}
    <style nonce="{{ csp_nonce }}">
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #f8f9fa;
            color: #212529;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        .card {
            max-width: 28rem;
        }
        .spinner {
            width: 2.5rem;
            height: 2.5rem;
            margin: 0 auto 1rem;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 0.3rem solid #dee2e6;
            border-top-color: #0d6efd;
            animation: spin 0.8s linear infinite;
        }
        @keyframes spin {
            to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
        }
        p {
            color: #6c757d;
            margin: 0.25rem 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="card">
        {# Decorative: the heading under it says the same thing. #}
        <div class="spinner" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <h1>Mise à jour en cours</h1>
        <p>{{ status_label }}</p>
        <p>{{ elapsed_label }}</p>
        <p>Cette page se rafraîchit automatiquement — ou <a href="">actualisez-la</a>.</p>
    </div>
    <script nonce="{{ csp_nonce }}">
        setTimeout(function () { window.location.reload(); }, 10000);
    </script>
</body>
</html>
